{"quests":[{"id":"q_m01","type":"main","title":"A Humble Beginning","desc":"In Hall, tap the Tavern. Choose a candidate and press Hire. Claim this chapter from the quest tracker.","order":1,"goals":[{"stat":"hero.count","target":2,"mode":"abs","text":"Have 2 heroes"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":100}],"req":[],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: The hearth is lit, but a guild needs more than one brave soul. Visit the Tavern. Bring someone home.","hint":"bld_tavern","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m02","type":"main","title":"Your First Mission","desc":"Open Board > Campaign > Sunmeadow Plains. Start Slime Meadow, select your heroes and press Fight.","order":2,"goals":[{"stat":"missions.won","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Win a battle"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":80},{"id":"potion_s","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m01","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: The farmers need a little help. Open Campaign on the Board and start Slime Meadow. Take your new teammate into battle.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m03","type":"main","title":"Gear Up","desc":"Open Bag > Gear and tap Auto equip. Claim this chapter from the quest tracker when your heroes are equipped.","order":3,"goals":[{"stat":"gear.equipped","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Equip an item"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":100},{"id":"iron_ore","n":6}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m02","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Good steel keeps a friend safe. Open Gear in the Bag and use Auto equip to prepare every hero for the next journey.","hint":"tab_bag","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m04","type":"main","title":"Rookie's Triumph","desc":"On Board > Campaign, clear Gooey Hills, then Mushroom Grove. Keep your party healthy between battles.","order":4,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r1_3","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Clear Mushroom Grove"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":150},{"id":"fame","n":8}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m03","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: The grove feeds half the village. Clear the creatures from it, and our neighbors can harvest without fear.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m05","type":"main","title":"Forge Ahead","desc":"Build the Blacksmith in the Guild Hall.","order":5,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.blacksmith","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Blacksmith"}],"rewards":[{"id":"iron_ore","n":10},{"id":"gems","n":3}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m04","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Brannock's old anvil is waiting. Restore the Blacksmith, and fill our hall with the cheerful ring of hammers.","hint":"bld_blacksmith","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m06","type":"main","title":"Strength Through Sweat","desc":"Build the Training Hall.","order":6,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.training","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Training Hall"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":200},{"id":"tome_s","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m05","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Old training marks still line the courtyard. Build the Training Hall. Give our new heroes a place to grow.","hint":"bld_training","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m07","type":"main","title":"Train a Hero","desc":"Send a hero to train in the Training Hall.","order":7,"goals":[{"stat":"train.done","target":1,"mode":"delta","text":"Finish a training session"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":150},{"id":"tome_s","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m06","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Talent is a spark. Practice makes it a flame. Send a hero to train, then bring that strength to the next battle.","hint":"bld_training","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m08","type":"main","title":"The Slime Throne","desc":"Defeat the King Slime at the end of Sunmeadow Plains.","order":8,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r1_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat King Slime"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":300},{"id":"gems","n":5},{"id":"soul_seal","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m07","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Every trail ends at the Slime King's nest. Break its hold on Sunmeadow, and open the road for everyone behind us.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m09","type":"main","title":"Prove Your Worth","desc":"Earn 100 Fame to become eligible for the Rank E exam.","order":9,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.fame","target":100,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach 100 Fame"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":3},{"id":"gold","n":200}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m08","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: We cannot restore a reputation with a name alone. Earn 100 Fame. Let our deeds speak before the Association.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m10","type":"main","title":"Rank E Trial","desc":"Pass the Rank E exam from the Quest Board.","order":10,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank E"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":500},{"id":"gems","n":10},{"id":"x_amulet_2","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m09","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: The Association has sent its trial. Pass the Rank E exam, and our banner may cross into Whisperwood.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m11","type":"main","title":"Into the Whisperwood","desc":"Clear Moonlit Glade in Whisperwood.","order":11,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r2_3","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Clear Moonlit Glade"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":350},{"id":"fame","n":20}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m10","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Blue lights dance between the trees. Explore Moonlit Glade. There are wonders in Whisperwood we have yet to discover.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m12","type":"main","title":"Mend and Make Do","desc":"Build the Infirmary so wounded heroes can recover.","order":12,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.infirmary","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Infirmary"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":250},{"id":"potion_m","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m11","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Even the bravest hero needs a soft bed sometimes. Build the Infirmary, and give everyone a warm place to recover.","hint":"bld_infirmary","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m13","type":"main","title":"Strength in Numbers","desc":"Grow your guild to 5 heroes.","order":13,"goals":[{"stat":"hero.count","target":5,"mode":"abs","text":"Have 5 heroes"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":5},{"id":"gold","n":400}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m12","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: There are empty chairs at our table. Welcome five heroes, and turn this shelter into a guild again.","hint":"bld_tavern","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m14","type":"main","title":"Queen of Coils","desc":"Defeat the Lamia Queen in her lair.","order":14,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r2_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat the Lamia Queen"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":600},{"id":"gems","n":8},{"id":"soul_seal","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m13","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: The Lamia Queen guards a hidden forest trail. Challenge her in the lair, and find out where that winding path leads.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m15","type":"main","title":"Rank D Trial","desc":"Reach Guild Rank D.","order":15,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":2,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank D"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":1000},{"id":"gems","n":15},{"id":"x_ring_3","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m14","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: Traders speak of glittering ruins beyond the dunes. Earn Rank D, and prepare our guild for a grand desert adventure.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m16","type":"main","title":"The Beast Within","desc":"Tame a monster at the Tavern's Beast Den.","order":16,"goals":[{"stat":"monster.tamed","target":1,"mode":"delta","text":"Tame a monster"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":10},{"id":"essence","n":5}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m15","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Maren: A guild can welcome all kinds of companions. Visit the Beast Den and invite a creature to adventure beneath our banner.